pdflx (0.4.3) noble; urgency=medium

  * New highlight eraser tool for partial or whole highlight removal in edit
    and view mode, with a matching cursor and a shared highlight menu.
  * View-mode highlighter draws freehand marker strokes; text highlights use
    the same translucent marker look.
  * Long stamp text wraps onto two lines; stamp text length is limited.
  * Sticky notes can be moved by dragging.

 -- pdfLX contributors <pdflx@localhost>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 08:00:00 +0200

pdflx (0.4.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Clicking an element no longer moves it; drags start after a small threshold.
  * Editing original cells and shapes keeps text on top, neighbouring graphics,
    links, and outlines intact.
  * Thin rules and separator lines are selectable and editable.

