pdflx (0.4) noble; urgency=medium

  * AI assistant (OpenRouter, user-chosen model) that edits documents, builds
    forms, adds pages, and recreates pages from pictures.
  * Form builder with quick fields, form style, labels, alignment guides,
    multiple copies, tab order, field detection, and field scripts.
  * Multi-field align/distribute/size, form submission, and new shapes,
    lines, arrows, and shape options.
  * Find and Replace, sensitive-data redaction, Organize Pages, stacking
    order, and alignment guides for all objects.
  * Reorganized menus and toolbar.
  * Fix text moving when edited and an undo problem with later text edits.

 -- pdfLX contributors <pdflx@localhost>  Sun, 04 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0200

