pdflx (0.2) noble; urgency=medium

  * Grouped menus and libadwaita dialogs; Pages and Protect sidebar menus.
  * Page tools: insert, extract, split, collate, blank removal, resize, N-up,
    booklet, overlays, headers/footers and Bates numbering, labels, boxes.
  * Protection: passwords and permissions, sanitization, hidden-text scan,
    rasterizing, signature verification with PKCS#7 details, and append-only
    saving that keeps existing signatures valid.
  * Conversion and export: other formats and images to PDF, optimization,
    recolouring, page images, structured text, tables, diagrams.
  * Review: native markup annotations, replies, review states, filters,
    import/export, comment summaries, annotation flattening.
  * Forms: password, comb, and multi-select fields, border styles, field
    hierarchy, and a JavaScript inspector.
  * Authoring: Markdown/HTML documents with linked contents, formatted text,
    watermarks, shapes, node editing, and CSV mail merge.
  * Viewer: two-page and book layouts, presentation mode, measurement,
    side-by-side pane, reading colours, faster rendering for large zoom.
  * Autosave crash recovery, remembered positions, recent-file thumbnails,
    and the pdflx-cli batch tool.
  * Form scripts (calculation, validation, formatting) via MuPDF's sandboxed
    JavaScript engine, a Format & Calculation tab, date picker, submit/URL/
    print/JavaScript buttons, and FDF/XFDF/JSON/CSV form data import/export.
  * Requires libadwaita 1.5 or newer.

 -- pdfLX contributors <pdflx@localhost>  Fri, 02 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0200

